        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="KFP8RPL6mIDQRkqsjRhr-174" parent="1" style="line;strokeWidth=3;direction=south;html=1;strokeColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#E6E6E6);" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="182" width="10" x="966" y="932.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="KFP8RPL6mIDQRkqsjRhr-175" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Separate group reports from individual observations:&lt;/b&gt; A sighting can exist without&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;known individual whales, Group observations store reported pod or group information,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Keep family relationships separate from recorded associations: &lt;/b&gt;Kinship (e.g. mother-offspring)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;represents biological relationships, while Association represents observed or derived social links.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;Preserve sources and identification information:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;Each record retains its data source and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;identification status/basis to capture evidence provenance and confidence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. Distinguish recorded evidence from potential association candidates: &lt;/b&gt;Associations can be&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;stored as derived or predicted relationships with method and evidence level, separate from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;recorded observations and known kinship.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="193" width="639" x="979" y="932.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="KFP8RPL6mIDQRkqsjRhr-176" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;b&gt;Key Modeling Decisions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
